description:
A JUnit Jupiter extension that provisions a fresh XaScenarioEngine per
    test, resolves it as a test-method parameter, supports declarative
    @XaFault rules with a "did it actually fire" assertion, and attaches a
    timeline report to failing tests. junit-jupiter-api is a compile-scope
    dependency because this module's whole purpose is JUnit integration;
    every other dependency remains test-scoped.
